    <briefdescription>
<para>Mixed outflow/inflow BC: zeroGradient on faces with outward flux, fixedValue (inletValue) on faces with inward flux. Mirrors OpenFOAM&apos;s inletOutletFvPatchField. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Flow direction is determined from the boundary face velocity:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>For Vec3 fields: reads lagged boundary velocity from domainVector.boundaryData().value().</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>For scalar fields: requires &quot;U&quot; in BoundaryContext; defaults to zeroGradient without it. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
